  nameText: {fileID: 0}
  sentenceText: {fileID: 244010558}
  TypingSpeedPerSecond: 25
  sent: "Something has come back from deep space, and nobody has opened it yet.\nAnderson:
    This isnt just a rock. Its an archive billions of years old\u2026\nReal missions
    have gone out and brought samples home before. Their files are waiting in the
    lab archive.\nAnderson: If life can be built from these things, I have to find
    a place that can hold my family."
